exit: 0

$ govctl adr edit ADR-0001 alternatives[0] --tick rejected
Marked 'Option A' as rejected
exit: 0

$ govctl adr edit ADR-0001 alternatives[1] --tick rejected
Marked 'Option B' as rejected
exit: 0

$ govctl adr edit ADR-0001 decision --set We chose A.
error[E0303]: ADR alternatives incomplete: at least 1 accepted alternative required. Use --force to bypass for historical backfills. (ADR-0001)
exit: 1
